{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55134","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三传将，遥日（辛本、川本、京本作「见」）觅支干。\n将见支干休进战，三神被克我军（京本作「神」）安，必获彼旗旛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}